                <pb facs="1128" n="978" sameAs="frus:frus1907p2/pg978"/>

                <head>[Inclosure 1.—Translation.]</head>
                <p rendition="#center">(Receipt No. 83796 for rubles 5,820. The Central
                    Administration of the Russian Red Cross.)</p>
                <p>On May 5 (18), 1907, the treasury received and entered, under article No. 3719,
                    from the American Red Cross Society, for the relief of famine sufferers, 5,820
                    rubles.</p>
                <closer><signed>
                        <list>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">V. Tonkoff</hi>, <hi
                                    rendition="#italic">Treasurer.</hi></item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">B. Koshenikoff</hi>, <hi
                                    rendition="#italic">Comptroller.</hi></item>
                        </list>
                    </signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
